		"hero/Wraith/ability/Card Trick/tooltip_details/info_sections/0/loc_string": "Deal weapon damage to summon cards of a random suit. Each card can be thrown, dealing damage and applying a different effect depending on its suit. Cards thrown fly towards the enemy or point under your crosshair. <br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Alt-cast to throw first card</span>",
